WHAT THIS COVERS

Everything in this repository written by StevenC: src/, bin/, build.cmd,
README.md, CHANGELOG.md.  Take it, ship it, sell it, no attribution
required.

ONE EXCEPTION

tools/MNASMFIX.COM is not mine.  It is mininasm -- https://github.com/pts/mininasm
-- with the read-only-output bug patched out, bundled only so the driver
can be rebuilt on a DOS machine with nothing else installed.  It stays
under whatever terms its own authors put it under; the dedication above
does not and cannot apply to it.  Delete the file if you would rather not
carry it: nothing else in the repository depends on it, and nasm builds
the identical image.
